<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:40,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curse Sealing!</font>

39
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of character.</font>

40
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears he's quite tired...</font>

41
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you've become able to
handle Sealing Jutsu...</font>

42
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've grown, eh, Kakashi...?</font>

43
00:02:17,450 --> 00:02:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

44
00:02:26,290 --> 00:02:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see, Kakashi-kun.</font>

45
00:02:31,670 --> 00:02:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...</font>

46
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:39,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A touch-and-go</font>

47
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:39,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Situation!!</font>

48
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:39,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Kakashi vs Orochimaru</font>

49
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but...</font>

50
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no business with you, Kakashi-kun.</font>

51
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I do with the kid behind you.</font>

52
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you after Sasuke...?!</font>

53
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:04,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's good for you.
You already got it, right?</font>

54
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:08,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't have it before, did you...?</font>

55
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That.</font>

56
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That...</font>

57
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">left eye Sharingan!</font>

58
00:03:20,590 --> 00:03:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want it, too...</font>

59
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Uchiha power.</font>

60
00:03:40,650 --> 00:03:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on. Get up.</font>

61
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?!</font>

62
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Bugs?</font>

63
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They burst through the skin...
from inside his body?!</font>

64
00:04:26,030 --> 00:04:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a creepy guy!</font>

65
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! What kind of bluff
are you trying to pull?</font>

66
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:53,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These things are called Parasitic Insects.</font>

67
00:04:53,430 --> 00:04:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They attack their pray in groups
and eat Chakra...</font>

68
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If attacking in this amount...</font>

69
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:02,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're finished, no mistake.</font>

70
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't like that, give up.</font>

71
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be in your best interests.</font>

72
00:05:09,450 --> 00:05:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you use your left arm
technique on me,</font>

73
00:05:12,620 --> 00:05:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll simultaneously have the bugs exploit
the opening from behind.</font>

74
00:05:16,790 --> 00:05:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Conversely, if you use
your technique on the bugs,</font>

75
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll simultaneously exploit the opening...</font>

76
00:05:24,130 --> 00:05:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Either way, you won't be able
to get through this.</font>

77
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An ace in the hole is something
you set aside.</font>

78
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:42,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hold it!</font>

79
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little thief!</font>

80
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone! Grab him!</font>

81
00:06:02,170 --> 00:06:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

82
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, what a pigheaded kid.</font>

83
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Making us go to trouble!</font>

84
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have potential, boy.</font>

85
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I liked your eyes earlier...</font>

86
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you come with me,
you can become strong.</font>

87
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Follow me.</font>

88
00:08:26,150 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you come with me,
you can become strong.</font>

89
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can become strong.</font>

90
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight for me. If you do that...</font>

91
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make you stronger.</font>

92
00:10:00,990 --> 00:10:03,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, please live up to my expectations...</font>

93
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:13,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No longer...</font>

94
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will I...</font>

95
00:10:23,310 --> 00:10:26,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like you're proud
of your arms. You!</font>

96
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop it!</font>

97
00:10:33,230 --> 00:10:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

98
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No longer...</font>

99
00:10:44,990 --> 00:10:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can I make things
blow up in my face!</font>

100
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:57,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... underestimate me!</font>

101
00:11:15,270 --> 00:11:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An ace in the hole is something
you set aside, right?!</font>

102
00:11:32,370 --> 00:11:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An ace in the hole is something
you set aside, right?</font>

103
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! He could already
use his right arm?!</font>

104
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the first half of the battle was
a strategic move</font>

105
00:11:47,430 --> 00:11:50,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to make us think he couldn't
use his right arm.</font>

106
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not bad... Zaku.</font>

107
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your purpose?</font>

108
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The recently built Sound Village.
That's my village, you see...</font>

109
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You already understand, don't you...?</font>

110
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Ridiculous ambition.</font>

111
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my... you said it.</font>

112
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:29,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, for that I need various pieces
who will obey my every whim.</font>

113
00:12:31,430 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

114
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:37,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Sasuke is one of those pieces?</font>

115
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. Sasuke-kun is an exceptional piece.</font>

116
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the ones who are taking
the exams now...</font>

117
00:12:48,990 --> 00:12:50,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are mere throw-away pieces.</font>

118
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My arms!</font>

119
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

120
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earlier when I recommended
that you give up...</font>

121
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:25,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a precautionary measure,
I gave a suggestion to the bugs...</font>

122
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to block that troublesome wind hole
with their bodies and remain still.</font>

123
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what a real ace in the hole is.</font>

124
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Punk!</font>

125
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... come any closer... to Sasuke!</font>

126
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:30,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you're one of
the legendary Sannin,</font>

127
00:14:31,180 --> 00:14:34,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the least,
I can kill you as you kill me!</font>

128
00:14:46,900 --> 00:14:48,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's funny?</font>

129
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you say and what you do,
are all off.</font>

130
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:55,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

131
00:14:55,830 --> 00:14:59,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point at all in
attempting such a seal.</font>

132
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, don't you?</font>

133
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The heart to seek out
in pursuit of the goal,</font>

134
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what obstructive power
there may be...</font>

135
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is the possessor of that quality.</font>

136
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an avenger...</font>

137
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you took advantage of that, eh?</font>

138
00:15:18,730 --> 00:15:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, Sasuke is...</font>

139
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:24,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At some point,
he will definitely seek me out...</font>

140
00:15:26,530 --> 00:15:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in search of power.</font>

141
00:15:31,030 --> 00:15:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, and, you're going to kill me...?</font>

142
00:15:35,330 --> 00:15:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you try?</font>

143
00:15:37,700 --> 00:15:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is, if you can...</font>

144
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kill you as you kill me...?!</font>

145
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I an idiot...?</font>

146
00:16:16,070 --> 00:16:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems... it's over.</font>

147
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:22,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner! Aburame Shino!</font>

148
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:34,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is he, Neji?!</font>

149
00:16:38,970 --> 00:16:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

150
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's something else...!</font>

151
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can understand him calling bugs
with a Summoning Jutsu...</font>

152
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he harbors bugs all over his body.</font>

153
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:56,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Say what?!</font>

154
00:16:56,820 --> 00:17:00,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's of the bug tamer race that
is passed down in the Leaf Village.</font>

155
00:17:01,250 --> 00:17:03,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speaking of which,
I've heard of it...</font>

156
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The story of a race that as
they come into this world,</font>

157
00:17:06,710 --> 00:17:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">possess the secret technique of loaning
their bodies to bugs</font>

158
00:17:10,050 --> 00:17:14,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a nest and fight using these bugs.</font>

159
00:17:17,090 --> 00:17:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They fully control the bugs and
entrust most of the battle to the bugs...</font>

160
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear that they contract to keep
giving the bugs their own Chakra</font>

161
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as food for compensation.</font>

162
00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:39,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he's... the successor?</font>

163
00:17:43,370 --> 00:17:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was unfortunate, Zaku.</font>

164
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd that happen to Zaku's arms?</font>

165
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably, that guy called
Shino or whatever...</font>

166
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">exploited the opening and
stuck those bugs</font>

167
00:17:56,130 --> 00:17:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">into the exhaust opening in Zaku's hands.</font>

168
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:02,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he were to fire the Slicing Sonic Wave
in that condition,</font>

169
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the energy with no way out
would expand in search of an exit...</font>

170
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His arms that are
gun barrels blow up...</font>

171
00:18:14,570 --> 00:18:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and become useless.</font>

172
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our relationship was only that
of having been given the same mission...</font>

173
00:18:30,210 --> 00:18:34,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but... I'll even the score for you.</font>

174
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whew. He gives me a chill, indeed...</font>

175
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! What?!</font>

176
00:18:43,010 --> 00:18:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Shino, you were that strong,
weren't you?! Damn it!</font>

177
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought he was
a creepy person from long before, but...</font>

178
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

179
00:18:57,530 --> 00:19:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Shino-kun, good... work...</font>

180
00:19:00,530 --> 00:19:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you did it!</font>

181
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I'm counting on you guys, too.</font>

182
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He comes back like he's
the team leader or something! Damn it!</font>

183
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:20,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm, now then, I would like to
get right to the next match.</font>

184
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:25,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

185
00:19:26,850 --> 00:19:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo!</font>

186
00:19:27,850 --> 00:19:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not, "Yo!" Kakashi-sensei!</font>

187
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about Sasuke-kun? Is he okay?</font>

188
00:19:33,650 --> 00:19:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, he's fine.</font>

189
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's sleeping soundly in the infirmary.</font>

190
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, with ANBU Ops
standing as guards...</font>

191
00:19:42,990 --> 00:19:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh.</font>

192
00:19:43,780 --> 00:19:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font color="#84844e"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Tsurugi Misumi</font></font></font></b></font>

193
00:19:43,780 --> 00:19:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font color="#84844e"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Kankuro</font></font></font></b></font>

194
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally my turn.</font>

195
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro, he's totally underestimating this...</font>

196
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. Idiot...</font>

197
00:20:14,690 --> 00:20:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's him...!</font>

198
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike Yoroi, I don't get
careless with kids at all.</font>

199
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll say this first, once I do my technique...</font>

200
00:20:37,090 --> 00:20:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">give up no matter what...</font>

201
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring it to an end swiftly.</font>

202
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, I'll also...</font>

203
00:20:47,390 --> 00:20:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">bring it to an end swiftly!</font>

204
00:20:56,020 --> 00:20:57,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, please begin...</font>

205
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the third battle!</font>

