<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">harmonia, feel the telepathy</font></b></font></font>

234
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font></font>

235
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

236
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I believed in your words the whole time.</font>

237
00:22:41,170 --> 00:22:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I wanted to be like you.</font>

238
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I thought it would be nice
if that happened.</font>

239
00:22:45,510 --> 00:22:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">So Ino, I want to fight the full-tilt you.</font>

240
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm no longer like I was before.</font>

241
00:22:51,890 --> 00:22:55,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">There's no point if I don't
exceed the serious you.</font>

242
00:22:56,730 --> 00:23:00,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Rivals Clash! The Hearts of the Girls are in Serious Mode."</font>

243
